    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετάκειμαι</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείσομαι</span>, used as 
